1
00:00:00,148 --> 00:00:03,318
(Sheldon:)And I certainly don't need someone
telling on me to my mother.

2
00:00:04,777 --> 00:00:06,027
Wait, where are you going?

3
00:00:06,195 --> 00:00:09,235
To my room and no one's allowed in.

4
00:00:09,532 --> 00:00:10,702
[DOOR SLAMS]

5
00:00:10,867 --> 00:00:13,327
- He gets his temper from his daddy.
- Ah.

6
00:00:13,494 --> 00:00:15,874
- He's got my eyes.
- I see.

7
00:00:16,372 --> 00:00:19,582
(Mrs Cooper:)All that science stuff,
that comes from Jesus.

8
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:24,420
Sheldon, your mom made dinner.

9
00:00:24,589 --> 00:00:25,629
SHELDON:
I'm not hungry.

10
00:00:25,798 --> 00:00:28,718
(Mrs Cooper:)Oh. Leonard, don't trouble yourself.
He's stubborn.

11
00:00:28,885 --> 00:00:30,965
He may stay in there till the rapture.

12
00:00:32,555 --> 00:00:34,805
(Penny:)Are we so sure that's a bad thing?

13
00:00:34,974 --> 00:00:36,434
(Mrs Cooper:)I love the boy to death...

14
00:00:36,601 --> 00:00:40,691
(Mrs Cooper:)...but he has been difficult
since he fell out of me at the Kmart.

15
00:00:42,690 --> 00:00:44,070
(Howard:)Excuse me for being so bold...

16
00:00:44,233 --> 00:00:48,073
(Howard:)...but I now see where Sheldon gets
his smoldering good looks.

17
00:00:48,237 --> 00:00:52,287
Oh. Honey, that ain't gonna work,
but you keep trying.

18
00:00:53,451 --> 00:00:54,871
(Mrs Cooper:)I made chicken.

19
00:00:55,453 --> 00:01:05,023
(Mrs Cooper:)I hope that isn't one of the animals
that you people think is magic.

